  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Breaching the Justice Gap in Brazil through CNJ</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">&quot;The proposed IDF Grant is designed to strengthen the capacity of the Brazil&apos;s National Council for Justice (Conselho Nacional de Justica - CNJ) to promote geographic equality and contribute to reduce the gaps existing between the judiciaries of the most advanced states and the poorest states in Brazil by improving thequalitiy of public spending in three to five pilot states in which the deficiencies of the judiciary are more acute.  3/23/11 MHiggins (LEGRA): &quot;&quot;Responsible&quot;&quot; unit is LCC5C in FY11 to allow Brazil CMU to fund estimated $7500 in STC costs. Responsible unit will become LEGLA in FY12 (with LCC5C as requesting unit). Initial budget of $40comma000 is proposed for FY12 WPA. IDF committee has waitlisted project for IDF grant funding (following CN &amp; project approval)comma with effectiveness currently expected in FY12.&quot;</narrative>
  </description>
